WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.616
"There," Tor said.

2
00:00:08.617 --> 00:00:14.591
She put the egg in the nest.

3
00:00:14.592 --> 00:00:18.860
Suddenly the dark shadow appeared.

4
00:00:18.861 --> 00:00:23.109
"Uh-oh," Sid said.

5
00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:28.756
The buddies looked up.

6
00:00:28.757 --> 00:00:32.786
A big dino smiled down at them.

7
00:00:32.787 --> 00:00:37.526
"I'm sorry I scared you," she said.

8
00:00:37.527 --> 00:00:42.351
"I just wanted my egg back."

9
00:00:42.352 --> 00:00:46.277
Tor sighed.

10
00:00:46.278 --> 00:00:50.523
"I'm sorry I took your egg."

11
00:00:50.524 --> 00:00:54.631
"It's okay," the big dino said.

12
00:00:54.632 --> 00:01:02.101
"Thank you for bringing it back."

13
00:01:02.102 --> 00:01:07.661
"When will your eggs hatch?" Sara asked.

14
00:01:07.662 --> 00:01:12.912
"They will hatch soon," the big dino said.

15
00:01:12.913 --> 00:01:17.139
"You can come back and visit."

16
00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:20.002
"Yay!" Sara said.

17
00:01:20.003 --> 00:01:33.415
"I love baby dinos!"

18
00:01:33.416 --> 00:01:43.769
The buddies walked back to the park.

19
00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:49.037
"You have the best roar, Rex," Sid said.

20
00:01:49.038 --> 00:01:52.222
Tor and Sara nodded.

21
00:01:52.223 --> 00:01:55.312
"Let's hear it again," Tor said.

22
00:01:55.313 --> 00:02:00.454
"Okay," Rex said.

23
00:02:00.455 --> 00:02:03.618
"Roar!"

24
00:02:03.619 --> 00:02:07.291
The whole forest shook.

25
00:02:07.292 --> 00:02:14.228
In the nest the eggs shook too!

